      <activity id="b926a95c-60e8-5458-b1f4-af909891a192" activityNameId="bb7118af-9865-57f9-97ec-378fb0b7e32e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Water, ultrapure, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Water, ultrapure, at plant
The process "water, ultrapure, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  ultrapure water   in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Emissions are calculated from the input properties. Infrastructure is estimated. Energy consumptions are calculated with literature data.;
CAS number: 007732-18-5; 
Formula: H2O; 
UUID: 60a0292b-3297-3fcc-97ce-dea4df098350
Production of ultrapure water including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: water electrodeionization
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Infrastructure is estimated. 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_60a0292b-3297-3fcc-97ce-dea4df098350.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
